{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj556fQK35Li3fqG5ByU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a plain, heavy door set deep in a stone frame. There is no handle. No hinges visible. Just a single keyhole, tarnished brass, at the center.*\n\n*A faint cold draft breathes through the keyhole.*\n\n*You feel it waiting.*\n\n*The keyhole is shaped unlike any you've seen — not a simple ward cut, but something organic, almost like the outline of a small, curled figure. A question seems to emanate from the metal itself, not in words, but in the particular way the emptiness of the hole holds your gaze.*\n\n**What do you offer?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":141,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}